{
  "slug": "cloud-finops",
  "name": "Cloud Finops",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Expert FinOps guidance for cloud, AI, SaaS, and data-platform spend. 21 reference files spanning AWS (CUR + Data Exports for FOCUS 1.2, Savings Plans incl. SageMaker AI + Database), Azure (Reservations, Savings Plans, EA-to-MCA contractual mechanics, AKS, MACC), GCP (BigQuery billing export, FOCUS, CUDs, Cloud Carbon Footprint), Anthropic, AWS Bedrock, Azure OpenAI / Foundry, Vertex AI, Databricks, Microsoft Fabric, Snowflake, OCI, AI coding tools, GreenOps, FinOps Framework 2024+2026, SaaS asset management, and ITAM. Multi-provider, model-agnostic, CC BY-SA 4.0. Refreshed bi-monthly via an automated pipeline scanning 29 cloud and FinOps sources, with each proposed update reviewed before landing.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `cloud-finops` (Expert FinOps guidance covering cloud, AI, and SaaS technology spend).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cloud-finops@claude-community` from `OptimNow/cloud-finops-skills`.\n\nFull options, troubleshooting, and the model-agnostic API loader: see INSTALLATION.md.",
